      <mxCell id="hdr_banner" value="T218 • FORMAL LOGIC &amp; SPEC QUINE • ZERO-TRUST GUARDRAIL &amp; COMPLIANCE LENS • REGULATED ENTERPRISE
Formal OWL/SHACL Policy Guards &amp; RFC 8693 OBO vs. Prompt-Only &#x27;Ontology Washing&#x27;
Enforcing deterministic pre-execution constraint proofs, narrow-audience OBO tokens, and immutable audit lineage in regulated pharma &amp; banking.
Stack Anchor: Google Cloud Vertex AI + Spanner Graph + Model Armor + OpenTelemetry  |  KPIs: 0 Static Agent Keys · 100% PII Redacted · Deterministic Kill Switch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
