      <mxCell id="SubBanner" value="GOVERNANCE &amp; PERSONA CONTRACT: Security Mandate: AI colleagues build, deterministic scripts prove, a human owner decides (y/N).
HIPAA / SOX / GxP Deterministic Audit Trail • VPC-SC + Customer-Managed Encryption (CMEK)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
