      <mxCell id="quine_left" value="LEFT HEMISPHERE • FORMAL ONTOLOGY &amp; EXECUTABLE SPEC
Machine-Verifiable Soul (∀, ∃, SHACL, OWL)
• First-Order Description Logic &amp; SHACL shape constraints
• Development-Driven Literate Specification (`ensemble`)
• Explicit domain invariants, state transitions &amp; post-conditions
• Zero ambiguity: invalid states are rejected before model execution" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="208" width="420" height="320" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="quine_right" value="RIGHT HEMISPHERE • SHALLOW &#x27;ONTOLOGY WASHING&#x27;
Disconnected Metadata &amp; Prompt Drift
• Rebranding flat data catalogs as &#x27;ontologies&#x27; without axioms
• Hand-written prose specs that rot the moment code ships
• Unverified LLM JSON outputs with silent semantic hallucinations
• Result: brittle agents that fail on multi-hop reasoning" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="472" y="208" width="420" height="320" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="quine_s_1" value="01 • WORKING PROTOTYPE
Iterate in Real Code First
